 "script": [
  {
   "cue": [
    "title"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "小朋友们好！我们的身体，有五种神奇的感觉。今天，我们来一个一个认识它们。"
    },
    {
     "en": "senses"
    },
    {
     "zh": "感觉。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "map",
    "show:sense",
    "focus:sense"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "看、听、闻、尝、摸，这些感觉，英语叫"
    },
    {
     "en": "sense"
    },
    {
     "zh": "我们一共有五种感觉：",
     "cue": [
      "plural:sense"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "five senses"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:see",
    "focus:see"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "第一种，靠眼睛。眼睛能看见："
    },
    {
     "en": "see"
    },
    {
     "en": "Eyes can see."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:sight",
    "edge:see>sight",
    "edge:sense>sight",
    "focus:sight"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "能看见东西的本领，叫视觉："
    },
    {
     "en": "sight"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:hear",
    "focus:hear"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "第二种，靠耳朵。耳朵能听见："
    },
    {
     "en": "hear"
    },
    {
     "en": "Ears can hear."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:listen",
    "focus:listen"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "竖起耳朵，认认真真地去听，用"
    },
    {
     "en": "listen"
    },
    {
     "zh": "就像第七集的看和看见：主动去听，是"
    },
    {
     "en": "listen",
     "cue": [
      "focus:listen"
     ]
    },
    {
     "zh": "听到了，是",
     "cue": [
      "focus:hear"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "hear"
    },
    {
     "en": "Listen! Can you hear it?",
     "cue": [
      "focus:listen,hear"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:hearing",
    "edge:hear>hearing",
    "edge:listen>hearing",
    "edge:sight>hearing",
    "focus:hearing"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "能听见声音的本领，叫听觉："
    },
    {
     "en": "hearing"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:smell",
    "edge:hearing>smell",
    "focus:smell"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "第三种，靠鼻子。闻一闻，英语是"
    },
    {
     "en": "smell"
    },
    {
     "zh": "这个词，也是嗅觉的意思。"
    },
    {
     "en": "It smells good!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:taste",
    "edge:smell>taste",
    "focus:taste"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "第四种，靠舌头。尝一尝，英语是"
    },
    {
     "en": "taste"
    },
    {
     "zh": "它也是味觉的意思。舌头能尝出好多种味道："
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:sweet",
    "edge:taste>sweet",
    "focus:sweet"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "糖果是甜的："
    },
    {
     "en": "sweet"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:salty",
    "edge:taste>salty",
    "focus:salty"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "盐是咸的。盐，加上字母 y，就是咸的："
    },
    {
     "en": "salt"
    },
    {
     "en": "salty"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:sour",
    "edge:taste>sour",
    "focus:sour"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "柠檬是酸的："
    },
    {
     "en": "sour"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:bitter",
    "edge:taste>bitter",
    "focus:bitter"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "药是苦的："
    },
    {
     "en": "bitter"
    },
    {
     "en": "The medicine is bitter."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:touch",
    "edge:taste>touch",
    "focus:touch"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "第五种，靠手。摸一摸，英语是"
    },
    {
     "en": "touch"
    },
    {
     "zh": "它也是触觉的意思。"
    },
    {
     "en": "Hands can touch."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:feel",
    "edge:feel>touch",
    "focus:feel"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "摸到了东西，心里就有了感觉："
    },
    {
     "en": "feel"
    },
    {
     "en": "It feels soft."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:sight,hearing,smell,taste,touch"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "五种感觉，我们一起来数一数："
    },
    {
     "en": "sight",
     "cue": [
      "focus:sight"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "hearing",
